Title: {{jobTitle}}
Company: {{company}}
URL: {{url}}

Description excerpt:
{{description}}

Provide 3-5 bullet points: 1) Top red flags (if any), 2) Hidden positives, 3) Negotiation angles, 4) Whether this seems junior/mid/senior in disguise. Return ONLY a JSON array of objects with keys: title, description, severity (high/medium/low/info).

